"use strict";(self.webpackChunkwoocommerce_multivendor_marketplace_docs=self.webpackChunkwoocommerce_multivendor_marketplace_docs||[]).push([[8886],{28259(e,t,s){s.r(t),s.d(t,{comp:()=>m,data:()=>u});var n=s(20641);const i=s.p+"assets/img/all-news.f7427ea1.webp",a=s.p+"assets/img/admin-news-settings-live.98e7c183.png",o=s.p+"assets/img/admin-news-custom-date.4d6d238b.png",l=s.p+"assets/img/settings.35b30203.webp",r=s.p+"assets/img/admin-news-create-new-live.6ea147a5.png",d=s.p+"assets/img/admin-news-all-posts-live.7aca83b9.png",c=s.p+"assets/img/vendor-admin-news-table-live.a3ee8b73.png",h=s.p+"assets/img/vendor-new.0a266120.webp",g={},m=(0,s(66262).A)(g,[["render",function(e,t){return(0,n.uX)(),(0,n.CE)("div",null,t[0]||(t[0]=[(0,n.Fv)('<h1 id="admin-news" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#admin-news"><span>Admin News</span></a></h1><p>The <strong>Admin News</strong> feature allows the admin to create and publish news updates for vendors. Admins can also control the <strong>visibility of news for sellers</strong> based on marketplace requirements.</p><p>Through this module, marketplace administrators can broadcast critical announcements, policy updates, fee revisions, scheduled maintenance alerts, and seasonal campaign guidelines directly to vendor dashboards.</p><p><a class="doc-image-link" href="./assets/all-news.webp"><img src="'+i+'" alt="All News List"></a></p><hr><h2 id="access-path" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#access-path"><span>Access Path</span></a></h2><p>Marketplace administrators can access the Admin News module directly from the WordPress administrative dashboard:</p><ul><li><strong>Marketplace → Admin News</strong></li></ul><p>From this section, administrators can configure global news visibility settings, manage existing announcements, and create new posts for vendors.</p><hr><h2 id="admin-news-settings" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#admin-news-settings"><span>Admin News Settings</span></a></h2><p>When navigating to <strong>Marketplace → Admin News</strong>, the administrator lands on the <strong>Admin News Settings</strong> configuration page.</p><p><a class="doc-image-link" href="./assets/admin-news-settings-live.png"><img src="'+a+'" alt="Admin News Settings"></a></p><h3 id="quick-action-header-buttons" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#quick-action-header-buttons"><span>Quick Action Header Buttons</span></a></h3><p>At the top of the settings page, two primary action buttons provide instant navigation:</p><ul><li><strong>See All News</strong>: Opens the complete news management list to view published, draft, and trashed news.</li><li><strong>Add a New News</strong>: Opens the announcement creation screen to write a new news article.</li></ul><hr><h3 id="configuration-fields" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#configuration-fields"><span>Configuration Fields</span></a></h3><p>The settings form allows administrators to manage news visibility across the entire vendor base:</p><table><thead><tr><th style="text-align:left;">Setting Field</th><th style="text-align:left;">Field Type</th><th style="text-align:left;">Default</th><th style="text-align:left;">Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style="text-align:left;"><strong>Hide News from Vendors</strong></td><td style="text-align:left;">Multi-select dropdown</td><td style="text-align:left;">None</td><td style="text-align:left;">Select specific vendors who should <strong>not</strong> see the news section on their vendor dashboard.</td></tr><tr><td style="text-align:left;"><strong>Show news to Vendors</strong></td><td style="text-align:left;">Dropdown</td><td style="text-align:left;">From last 30 days</td><td style="text-align:left;">Define the historical date range of news visible on vendor dashboards.</td></tr><tr><td style="text-align:left;"><strong>Select the custom date</strong></td><td style="text-align:left;">Date picker</td><td style="text-align:left;">None</td><td style="text-align:left;">Visible only when &quot;From a custom date&quot; is chosen. Specifies an exact cutoff date.</td></tr></tbody></table><h4 id="_1-hide-news-from-vendors" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#_1-hide-news-from-vendors"><span>1. Hide News from Vendors</span></a></h4><ul><li>Uses a searchable multi-select dropdown listing all registered marketplace vendors.</li><li>Allows administrators to exclude specific vendor accounts from accessing the Admin News section entirely.</li><li>Selected vendors will not see the news section or announcements on their dashboard.</li><li>Helpful when running targeted news campaigns or restricting communication to specific vendor tiers.</li></ul><h4 id="_2-show-news-to-vendors" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#_2-show-news-to-vendors"><span>2. Show news to Vendors</span></a></h4><ul><li>Controls how far back vendors can see published announcements.</li><li>Available duration presets: <ul><li><strong>From last 7 days</strong>: Displays only news published within the past week.</li><li><strong>From last 30 days</strong> <em>(Default)</em>: Displays news published within the past month.</li><li><strong>From last 3 months</strong>: Extends visibility to announcements from the previous 90 days.</li><li><strong>From last 6 months</strong>: Extends visibility to announcements from the previous 180 days.</li><li><strong>From last 1 year</strong>: Displays announcements published within the last 365 days.</li><li><strong>From a custom date</strong>: Enables an exact cutoff date picker.</li></ul></li></ul><p><a class="doc-image-link" href="./assets/admin-news-custom-date.png"><img src="'+o+'" alt="Admin News Custom Date Filter"></a></p><h4 id="_3-select-the-custom-date" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#_3-select-the-custom-date"><span>3. Select the custom date</span></a></h4><ul><li>Appears dynamically when <strong>From a custom date</strong> is selected.</li><li>All news items published <strong>on or after</strong> this chosen date are displayed on the vendor dashboard.</li><li>Useful for milestone releases, new contract periods, or calendar-year transitions.</li></ul><p>After adjusting these fields, click <strong>Save Changes</strong> to apply the configuration.</p><hr><h2 id="create-news" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#create-news"><span>Create News</span></a></h2><ul><li>Click on <strong>Add New News</strong> to create a new announcement.</li><li>Enter the required news details such as: <ul><li>News title</li><li>Description/content</li><li>Visibility options</li></ul></li></ul><p><a class="doc-image-link" href="./assets/settings.webp"><img src="'+l+'" alt="Admin News Settings"></a></p><ul><li>Click <strong>Publish</strong> to make the news live.</li><li>Admin can also <strong>edit previously published news</strong> at any time.</li></ul><p><a class="doc-image-link" href="./assets/admin-news-create-new-live.png"><img src="'+r+'" alt="Add New News Screen"></a></p><h3 id="step-by-step-announcement-creation-process" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#step-by-step-announcement-creation-process"><span>Step-by-Step Announcement Creation Process</span></a></h3><p>To publish a clear and engaging announcement for vendors:</p><ol><li>Go to <strong>Marketplace → Admin News</strong> and click <strong>Add a New News</strong> (or click <strong>See All News → Add New News</strong>).</li><li><strong>Enter News Title</strong>: Add a concise, informative headline into the title field (e.g., <em>&quot;Scheduled Maintenance on Saturday Night&quot;</em> or <em>&quot;Updated Commission Rates for Q4&quot;</em>).</li><li><strong>Compose Content</strong>: Write the announcement body using the rich WordPress content editor: <ul><li>Use the <strong>Visual</strong> tab for standard WYSIWYG formatting (headings, lists, bold text, links, alignment).</li><li>Use the <strong>Text</strong> tab to insert custom HTML formatting or embedded media.</li><li>Click <strong>Add Media</strong> if you need to attach relevant diagrams, PDF policy documents, or banners.</li></ul></li><li><strong>Configure Publish Box</strong>: <ul><li><strong>Save Draft</strong>: Saves the current progress without showing it to sellers.</li><li><strong>Status</strong>: Toggle between <code>Draft</code>, <code>Pending Review</code>, and <code>Published</code>.</li><li><strong>Visibility</strong>: Keep as <code>Public</code> for regular vendor visibility, or use <code>Password protected</code> / <code>Private</code> for restricted administrative testing.</li><li><strong>Publish Immediately / Schedule</strong>: Set an immediate publication timestamp or schedule a future date and time.</li></ul></li><li><strong>Slug Box</strong>: Review and customize the URL slug if necessary.</li><li>Click <strong>Publish</strong> to push the announcement live to eligible vendors.</li></ol><hr><h2 id="news-visibility-options" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#news-visibility-options"><span>News Visibility Options</span></a></h2><p>While creating or editing news, the admin can control which sellers can see the announcement using the following options:</p><h3 id="show-news-to-sellers" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#show-news-to-sellers"><span>Show News to Sellers</span></a></h3><ul><li>When this option is enabled: <ul><li>The news is visible to <strong>all sellers</strong> in the marketplace.</li><li>Sellers can view the news from their <strong>Vendor Account Panel</strong>.</li></ul></li><li>Suitable for: <ul><li>General marketplace announcements</li><li>Policy updates</li><li>Feature releases</li><li>Maintenance notifications</li></ul></li></ul><hr><h3 id="hide-news-from-sellers" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#hide-news-from-sellers"><span>Hide News from Sellers</span></a></h3><ul><li>When this option is enabled: <ul><li>The news is <strong>hidden from sellers</strong>.</li><li>Only the admin can view the news in the admin panel.</li></ul></li><li>Useful for: <ul><li>Draft announcements</li><li>Internal testing</li><li>Temporarily disabling outdated or irrelevant news</li><li>Preparing announcements for future publishing</li></ul></li></ul><blockquote><p><strong>Note:</strong> The admin can toggle these options anytime by editing the news item.</p></blockquote><hr><h2 id="view-all-news" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#view-all-news"><span>View All News</span></a></h2><ul><li>Click on <strong>See All News</strong> to view the complete list of created news.</li><li>Displays: <ul><li>Active news</li><li>Hidden news</li><li>Previously published announcements</li></ul></li></ul><p><a class="doc-image-link" href="./assets/admin-news-all-posts-live.png"><img src="'+d+'" alt="All News List"></a></p><h3 id="news-management-interface-dimensions" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#news-management-interface-dimensions"><span>News Management Interface Dimensions</span></a></h3><p>The <strong>All News</strong> screen provides comprehensive management tools for maintaining announcements:</p><h4 id="_1-status-filter-tabs-views" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#_1-status-filter-tabs-views"><span>1. Status Filter Tabs (Views)</span></a></h4><p>At the top of the table, administrators can quickly switch between different post states:</p><ul><li><strong>All</strong>: Displays all news items regardless of status (with total item count).</li><li><strong>Published</strong>: Shows only active announcements currently eligible for vendor visibility.</li><li><strong>Draft</strong>: Lists saved drafts that are not yet visible to vendors.</li><li><strong>Trash</strong>: Contains temporarily deleted items that can be restored or permanently removed.</li></ul><h4 id="_2-search-filtering-dimensions" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#_2-search-filtering-dimensions"><span>2. Search &amp; Filtering Dimensions</span></a></h4><ul><li><strong>Filter by Date</strong>: A dropdown menu grouping posts by month and year (e.g., <em>All dates</em>, <em>October 2026</em>, <em>September 2026</em>). Select a month and click <strong>Filter</strong> to isolate announcements.</li><li><strong>Search Posts</strong>: Enter keywords into the search input box and click <strong>Search Posts</strong> to find specific announcements by title or content snippet.</li><li><strong>Bulk Actions</strong>: Select multiple news items using table checkboxes, choose an action from the dropdown (<strong>Bulk edit</strong> or <strong>Move to Trash</strong>), and click <strong>Apply</strong>.</li></ul><h4 id="_3-table-columns-row-actions" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#_3-table-columns-row-actions"><span>3. Table Columns &amp; Row Actions</span></a></h4><table><thead><tr><th style="text-align:left;">Table Column</th><th style="text-align:left;">Details Displayed</th><th style="text-align:left;">Available Actions</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style="text-align:left;"><strong>Checkbox</strong></td><td style="text-align:left;">Selection box for individual or bulk actions</td><td style="text-align:left;">Select all or individual records</td></tr><tr><td style="text-align:left;"><strong>Title</strong></td><td style="text-align:left;">News title and status indicator (e.g., <code>— Draft</code>)</td><td style="text-align:left;">Hover over row to reveal: <br>• <strong>Edit</strong>: Opens full edit screen<br>• <strong>Quick Edit</strong>: Opens inline editor<br>• <strong>Trash</strong>: Moves post to trash</td></tr><tr><td style="text-align:left;"><strong>Date</strong></td><td style="text-align:left;">Publication state (<code>Published</code> or <code>Last Modified</code>) with exact date and time</td><td style="text-align:left;">Click column header to sort ascending or descending</td></tr></tbody></table><h4 id="_4-quick-edit-capabilities" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#_4-quick-edit-capabilities"><span>4. Quick Edit Capabilities</span></a></h4><p>Clicking <strong>Quick Edit</strong> on any news row opens an inline editing drawer without leaving the page. Administrators can rapidly modify:</p><ul><li><strong>Title</strong>: Update the headline.</li><li><strong>Slug</strong>: Modify the permalink slug.</li><li><strong>Date</strong>: Adjust publication date, month, year, hour, and minute.</li><li><strong>Password / Private</strong>: Set a access password or toggle private status.</li><li><strong>Status</strong>: Change post status between <code>Published</code>, <code>Pending Review</code>, and <code>Draft</code>.</li></ul><hr><h2 id="vendor-visibility" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#vendor-visibility"><span>Vendor Visibility</span></a></h2><ul><li>Published and visible news appears in the vendor’s <strong>Vendor Account Panel</strong>.</li><li>Sellers can: <ul><li>View the announcement title</li><li>Read the full news content</li></ul></li></ul><p><a class="doc-image-link" href="./assets/vendor-admin-news-table-live.png"><img src="'+c+'" alt="Vendor News View"></a></p><h3 id="vendor-dashboard-interface" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#vendor-dashboard-interface"><span>Vendor Dashboard Interface</span></a></h3><p>Vendors access announcements from their dedicated vendor panel:</p><ol><li>The vendor logs in to their marketplace vendor account.</li><li>Under the dashboard navigation menu, they click <strong>News &amp; Notifications → Admin News</strong> (or access the <strong>Admin News</strong> section in their vendor dashboard).</li><li>The <strong>Admin News</strong> feed displays a structured table containing: <ul><li><strong>Title</strong>: The headline of the news announcement (clickable link).</li><li><strong>Description</strong>: A short preview excerpt of the news content.</li><li><strong>Published On</strong>: The exact date the announcement was published.</li></ul></li><li><strong>Reading Full News Details</strong>: The vendor clicks on the news headline to open the dedicated article view with full text, guidelines, embedded images, and links.</li></ol><p><a class="doc-image-link" href="./assets/vendor-new.webp"><img src="'+h+'" alt="Vendor News View"></a></p><hr><h2 id="use-cases" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#use-cases"><span>Use Cases</span></a></h2><ul><li><strong>Marketplace-wide announcements</strong>: Share platform milestones, holiday shipping guidelines, or promotional events.</li><li><strong>Vendor onboarding updates</strong>: Provide new sellers with helpful tips, policies, and marketplace standards.</li><li><strong>Policy or commission changes</strong>: Announce revisions to seller commission structures, payouts, or return policies.</li><li><strong>New feature releases</strong>: Educate vendors on new tools such as compare features, shipping addons, or reporting enhancements.</li><li><strong>Scheduled maintenance notifications</strong>: Give advance warning before server updates or marketplace downtime.</li></ul><hr><h2 id="best-practices-troubleshooting" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#best-practices-troubleshooting"><span>Best Practices &amp; Troubleshooting</span></a></h2><h3 id="best-practices-for-administrators" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#best-practices-for-administrators"><span>Best Practices for Administrators</span></a></h3><ul><li><strong>Keep Headlines Clear and Actionable</strong>: Use direct titles so vendors immediately understand the topic (e.g., <em>&quot;Urgent: Update Shipping Policies Before Dec 1&quot;</em>).</li><li><strong>Use Drafts for Review</strong>: Prepare announcements in <strong>Draft</strong> status so team members can review copy before publishing.</li><li><strong>Schedule in Advance</strong>: Use the WordPress scheduling feature to publish news at optimal vendor business hours.</li><li><strong>Review Date Cutoffs Regularly</strong>: Ensure the <strong>Show news to Vendors</strong> duration in Admin News Settings covers all relevant historical announcements.</li></ul><h3 id="troubleshooting-common-questions" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#troubleshooting-common-questions"><span>Troubleshooting Common Questions</span></a></h3><table><thead><tr><th style="text-align:left;">Issue</th><th style="text-align:left;">Probable Cause</th><th style="text-align:left;">Recommended Resolution</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style="text-align:left;"><strong>Vendors cannot see an announcement</strong></td><td style="text-align:left;">The news post status is set to Draft.</td><td style="text-align:left;">Go to <strong>Marketplace → Admin News → See All News</strong>, edit the post, and click <strong>Publish</strong>.</td></tr><tr><td style="text-align:left;"><strong>Vendor reports news table is empty</strong></td><td style="text-align:left;">The post publication date is older than the configured timeframe in settings.</td><td style="text-align:left;">Go to <strong>Marketplace → Admin News</strong> and increase <strong>Show news to Vendors</strong> (e.g., from 30 days to 90 or 180 days, or choose <em>From a custom date</em>).</td></tr><tr><td style="text-align:left;"><strong>Specific vendor cannot see any news</strong></td><td style="text-align:left;">The vendor is listed under <strong>Hide News from Vendors</strong>.</td><td style="text-align:left;">Go to <strong>Marketplace → Admin News</strong>, remove the vendor from the <strong>Hide News from Vendors</strong> multi-select field, and click <strong>Save Changes</strong>.</td></tr><tr><td style="text-align:left;"><strong>Accidentally deleted news post</strong></td><td style="text-align:left;">News was moved to Trash.</td><td style="text-align:left;">Go to <strong>Marketplace → Admin News → See All News</strong>, click the <strong>Trash</strong> tab, hover over the item, and click <strong>Restore</strong>.</td></tr></tbody></table><hr>',80)]))}]]),u=JSON.parse('{"path":"/documentation/admin-news.html","title":"Admin News","lang":"en-US","frontmatter":{"title":"Admin News","description":"Complete administrator guide for managing Admin News in WooCommerce Multi-Vendor Marketplace. Learn how to create announcements, configure vendor visibility, filter news lists, and manage publication schedules.","head":[["meta",{"name":"keywords","content":"woocommerce marketplace admin news, marketplace announcements, vendor news updates, admin news settings, seller visibility options, woocommerce multi vendor news, admin news filter"}],["meta",{"property":"og:title","content":"Admin News | WooCommerce Multi-Vendor Marketplace"}],["meta",{"property":"og:description","content":"Complete administrator guide for managing Admin News in WooCommerce Multi-Vendor Marketplace. Learn how to create announcements, configure vendor visibility, filter news lists, and manage publication schedules."}],["meta",{"property":"og:type","content":"article"}]]},"headers":[{"level":2,"title":"Access Path","slug":"access-path","link":"#access-path","children":[]},{"level":2,"title":"Admin News Settings","slug":"admin-news-settings","link":"#admin-news-settings","children":[{"level":3,"title":"Quick Action Header Buttons","slug":"quick-action-header-buttons","link":"#quick-action-header-buttons","children":[]},{"level":3,"title":"Configuration Fields","slug":"configuration-fields","link":"#configuration-fields","children":[]}]},{"level":2,"title":"Create News","slug":"create-news","link":"#create-news","children":[{"level":3,"title":"Step-by-Step Announcement Creation Process","slug":"step-by-step-announcement-creation-process","link":"#step-by-step-announcement-creation-process","children":[]}]},{"level":2,"title":"News Visibility Options","slug":"news-visibility-options","link":"#news-visibility-options","children":[{"level":3,"title":"Show News to Sellers","slug":"show-news-to-sellers","link":"#show-news-to-sellers","children":[]},{"level":3,"title":"Hide News from Sellers","slug":"hide-news-from-sellers","link":"#hide-news-from-sellers","children":[]}]},{"level":2,"title":"View All News","slug":"view-all-news","link":"#view-all-news","children":[{"level":3,"title":"News Management Interface Dimensions","slug":"news-management-interface-dimensions","link":"#news-management-interface-dimensions","children":[]}]},{"level":2,"title":"Vendor Visibility","slug":"vendor-visibility","link":"#vendor-visibility","children":[{"level":3,"title":"Vendor Dashboard Interface","slug":"vendor-dashboard-interface","link":"#vendor-dashboard-interface","children":[]}]},{"level":2,"title":"Use Cases","slug":"use-cases","link":"#use-cases","children":[]},{"level":2,"title":"Best Practices & Troubleshooting","slug":"best-practices-troubleshooting","link":"#best-practices-troubleshooting","children":[{"level":3,"title":"Best Practices for Administrators","slug":"best-practices-for-administrators","link":"#best-practices-for-administrators","children":[]},{"level":3,"title":"Troubleshooting Common Questions","slug":"troubleshooting-common-questions","link":"#troubleshooting-common-questions","children":[]}]}],"git":{},"filePathRelative":"documentation/admin-news.md"}')}}]);